  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Judiciary Modernization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin del Poder Judicial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WILL FINANCE ACTIVITIES IN THREE AREAS: (I) SUPPORT FOR THE RESTRUCTURING OF THE MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS AT THE SUPREME COURT; (II) STRENGTHEN MANAGERIAL AND PLANNING SYSTEMS IN THE JUDICIAL POWER; AND (III) IMPROVE COURT SERVICES AND ADMINISTRATION, INTRODUCING NEW CASE MANAGEMENT INFORMATION SYSTEMS ON A PILOTM BASIS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
